[00:04.988]I'm sorry for dragging you all the way.
{"很抱歉一路拖累着你"}
[00:07.421]I just hope you didn't think I'm mad or so.
{"只希望你别以为我在生气"}
[00:10.378](For all l've done)
{"（为我所做的一切）"}
[00:12.006]Just take a breath,make yourself.
{"深呼吸　让自己平静"}
[00:14.411]Cause there's something you may not could imagine since you closed your eyes.
{"因你闭眼后　有些事或许难以想象"}
[00:18.055]But it's nothing scary.
{"但这并不恐怖"}
[00:19.711]Nothing to be afraid of.
{"没什么好害怕"}
[00:21.619]More it's like a taste of a breeze from the south.
{"更像是南方微风轻拂的滋味"}
[00:25.500]Might be crunchy in the morning and bright in the night.
{"清晨或许清脆　夜晚或许明亮"}
[00:29.235]You can get it,I believe you did?
{"你能理解的　我相信你已经明白"}
[00:34.241](Now concentrate)
{"（现在集中精神）"}
[00:39.223]Can you listen all the things around your knees?
{"可听见膝边萦绕的声响"}
[00:43.168]Rabbit hop,water drop.
{"兔子蹦跳　水滴轻落"}
[00:45.087]Whole reflection of yourself.
{"你完整的倒影"}
[00:47.091]Feeling dizzy of the spectacle.
{"对这奇景感到晕眩"}
[00:51.574]Life is ever changing.
{"生活永远在变"}
[00:54.398]Not so entertaining.
{"并不那么有趣"}
[01:12.148]Nothing to care.
{"无需在意"}
[01:13.472]Nothing to lose.
{"不会失去"}
[01:15.512]And no need to  hesitate.
{"也不必犹豫"}
[01:17.673]Play like you never did before.
{"像从未尝试过那样去玩耍"}
[01:21.553]Grab the beauty of the world.(beauty of the world we never knew)
{"抓住世间之美（我们从未知晓的美丽）"}
[01:25.922]All the joys and wonders you might be wanted to but you never knew that even exist.
{"所有你或许渴望却不知存在的喜悦与奇迹"}
[01:32.111]Here's everything you're looking for.
{"你所追寻的尽在此处"}
[01:36.760]There's no reason to be shy,just spread the wings of possibilities on your back and fly
{"无需羞怯　展开背上的可能性之翼翱翔吧"}
[01:48.462]I don't know,go random!
{"我不知道，随便来一个！"}
[01:56.227]Cmon,which one?
{"快点，选哪个？"}
[02:02.999]Play like you never did before.
{"像从未演奏过那样尽情发挥。"}
